  concept: 'Authored objective: Restore fan feedback and prove thermal protection.

    Authored
    requirement: Show motor power with absent tach, prove the loaded cutoff, replace
    the matching spare and rerun thermal qualification.

    General teaching principle:
    A feedback controller compares measured behavior with a reference and acts subject
    to plant dynamics and limits.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence can
    establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: Steering toward a target works only if the feedback accurately describes
    where you are.
